### GET - Obtener documentos de un cliente (ADMIN ve todos)
# Requiere: @adminToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents?entityType=client&entityId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### GET - Obtener documentos de un cliente (CLIENT solo ve visibles)
# Requiere: @clientToken
# GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents?entityType=client&entityId=1
# Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### GET - Obtener documento por ID (ADMIN)
# Requiere: @adminToken
# GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents/1
# Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### GET - Obtener documento por ID (CLIENT solo ve visibles, 403 si no)
# Requiere: @clientToken
# GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents/1
# Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### GET - Listar todos los documentos (requiere JWT)
# Requiere: @adminToken
# GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents?page=1&limit=10
# Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### DELETE - Eliminar documento (requiere JWT)
# Requiere: @adminToken
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents/1
# Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


